# Garver 6-bus (remote-generation scenario)
# AC/DC-FACTS transmission expansion planning benchmark.
# All-technologies case: candidate AC circuits, VSC-HVDC links, SSSCs,
# STATCOMs and modular capacitor banks are simultaneously available.
# Per-unit on Sbase = 100 MVA. Pure investment objective (CRF = 1,
# OPF_SCALE = 0). Demands are scaled by load_scale = 1.40.
# Bus 6 hosts 610 MW and is initially disconnected from the network.
# Costs: MISO MTEP24 Transmission Cost Estimation Guide (USD 2024).
# See README.md for parameter derivation and reproduction instructions.
#
param load_scale := 1.40;
param Sbase := 100;
param refbus := 1;
